  "title": "Esther walks in uninvited",
  "text": "A decree went out across the empire. Every Jew, marked for death. And a young queen sat safe behind the palace walls, saying nothing. Mordecai sent word. Who knows but that you have come to your royal place for such a time as this. To approach the king uninvited meant death. Esther fasted three days, fixed her crown, and stepped into the throne room anyway. The king raised his golden scepter. She lived. This is Grace. Come and hear the rest.",
